    /**     * Compile an HLSL pair and create a pipeline (root signature + both PSO variants).     *     * <p>The JNI version took a hand-packed little-endian `ByteBuffer`; this takes the     * structured [MCDRPipelineDesc] and packs it through [MCDRLayout]. Both ends     * now share one definition, which is what removes the wrong-offset class of bug — and     * with it the positional re-association of semantic names that the old separate     * `semanticCount` section required.     *     * @return native pipeline handle; 0 on failure (see [D3D12LastError])     */
